  "description": "Juwon’s just had the worst breakup of his life. So what does he do to get over his jerk of an ex? Sleep with his best friend, of course. Jiwook’s always been there when Juwon’s needed someone, always coming right over without question. But then, he has to go and talk about his feelings during their drunken night of sex… But maybe it isn’t a bad thing, since Juwon’s been starting to look at Jiwook differently since that night, too. Maybe going out with your good-looking best friend won’t be that bad at all. Just friends, friends with benefits, or lovers? The tension between the two becomes palpable, and whatever they’ve become now, it sure tastes sweet like vanilla… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a 3-chapter side story*",
